    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738670/extras/5729ee962b31058cfd06814c01d0af47.avif?t=1753558207\" data-has-big width=800 height=362 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever wanted to be the sexual stress relief for a bunch of unstable monster-girl mercenaries? Enjoy over eighteen interactive, uncensored, multi-artwork sex scenes!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From everyone's favorite sweet company fox-mom Aio, to the bratty Shizu who puts the 'aggravated' in 'aggravated assault with a deadly weapon'; you've got two unique flavors of Kitsune to enjoy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or if eccentric intelligence is more your style, feel free to interact with Kyva the boozy but brilliant in-house chemist! She's a lizard-serpent-reptile-lady-thing with a thicc tail and zero social intelligence, what's not to love?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, few are as cold as Adelaide the ice-wielding close-quarters-combatant elf! She's not easily impressed, rarely amused, and a strict teacher. However, just below the surface, she has a submissive streak if you know how to find it...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring animated character sprites with voice-line matching animated mouths that bring our mercenaries to life, as well as over a dozen professionally animated climax scenes to add that extra layer of quality to our spicy H-scenes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hilarious fully voiced dialogue, and lustful moan-filled sex scenes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced by a Legendary roster of NSFW Voice actors such as OpaluVA, MidnightDatura, Chloe Angel, and @Shennychwan! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring an extensive range of dialogues full of dark comedy, saucy sluttiness, and fascinating insights into the fractured world PMC Promiscuity takes place in! including additional guest voices from Gianni Matragrano, CinderDryad, Daltos, and more!\u00a0 <br><br>Additionally we boast an unforgettable custom OST by the talented musicians Coffee Run and Yukigloom! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Do you have what it takes to satisfy these insatiable horny mercenaries?</strong></u></h2>",
